WEBVTT

00:24:58.186 --> 00:25:00.415
I learned that it doesn't take
a lot of effort

00:25:00.439 --> 00:25:02.655
to go from feeling lonely
to feeling connected,

00:25:02.679 --> 00:25:04.142
even if it's from a distance.

00:25:05.180 --> 00:25:06.934
I was inspired by a mentor

00:25:06.958 --> 00:25:10.356
who encouraged me to think about
the people who energize me.

00:25:10.380 --> 00:25:13.030
Jane Dutton: I just was very aware

00:25:13.054 --> 00:25:16.613
that certain interactions with people
would light me up,

00:25:16.637 --> 00:25:19.520
and others would, almost in the moment,

00:25:19.544 --> 00:25:21.566
well, they would be neutral
or deplete me.

00:25:21.590 --> 00:25:25.116
And I just knew I wanted
to hang around more

00:25:25.140 --> 00:25:26.780
with the people that lit me up

00:25:26.804 --> 00:25:32.216
or try to figure out what could I do
that would make people light me up.